│ Selection criteria: All prospective randomised, cluster‐randomised and quasi‐randomised trials evaluating the        │
│ effectiveness of community‐based intervention packages in reducing maternal and neonatal mortality and morbidities,  │
│ and improving neonatal outcomes.                                                                                     │
