package
   - Study 39 (protocol): Included as it describes a qualifying trial design even though results aren't reported
   - Study 33 (quasi-experimental): Excluded because outcomes don't match criteria despite being quasi-experimental

5. Geographic Distribution of Included Studies: Tanzania (1), India (1), Pakistan (2), Tanzania (1) - all low-resource 
settings consistent with review scope.

